==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Fuma Kotaro's English description contained an error where it said "Area attacks Slow Red/Dark. and Angels" instead of either "Slow Red, Dark and Angels" or "Slow Red/Dark/Angels".
*Fuma Kotaro first became obtainable in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] on March 20th, 2026.
*[[wikipedia:Fūma Kotarō|Fūma Kotarō]] was the leader of the Fūma ninja clan in the [[wikipedia:Sengoku period|Sengoku era]]. The name Fūma Kotarō was actually a title adopted by every Fūma leader as a pseudonym, but the most famous is the fifth, who is often portrayed as part-''[[wikipedia:Oni|oni]]'' and/or a rival to [[wikipedia:Hattori Hanzō|Hattori Hanzō]] in fiction.
*Nyanjutsu (にゃん術) is a pun on にゃん ''nyan'' (meow) and 忍術 ''[[wikipedia:Ninjutsu|ninjutsu]]''.

